<title>UK: VW prices convertible bond, ups to $250 mln.</title>
<headline>VW prices convertible bond, ups to $250 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following exchangeable notes issue has been priced and increased to $250 million from $200 million, lead manager UBS said on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VOLKSWAGEN INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  VOLKSWAGEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     3.00	MATURITY    24.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    24.JAN.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES  CONVERSION PRICE SET AT $534.22 (842.41 DEM) PER SHARE,</p>
<p>	  A 22 PCT PREMIUM (FOREX FIXED AT 1.5769 DEM/USD).</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
